# `.github/` stays untracked except for the feedback Agent/Release workflows:
# the workbench dispatches to them by filename, and GitHub cannot run a
# workflow that is not in the repository. Nothing else under .github is exposed.
.github/*
!.github/workflows/
.github/workflows/*
!.github/workflows/feedback-agent-*.yml
!.github/workflows/feedback-delivery.yml
!.github/workflows/feedback-runner-smoke.yml
